	Name	Date		Description
	----	----		-----------
	kkee	9/15/96   	Initial version.

DESCRIPTION:

	text/xgw-html --> text/xgwp-html parser. Parses HTML DTD 3.2
        (http://www.w3.org/pub/WWW/MarkUp/Wilbur/HTML32.dtd).
	It inputs and outputs the same data format. All this module
	does is ensure proper html tag grammar and nesting. This
	module can be made to be transparent if we know the document
	we are parsing is correct. Uses the filter table in htmlft.goc.

	$Id: htmlp.goc,v 1.1 97/04/07 11:51:13 newdeal Exp $

%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%*/


